LightSelect
===========

LightSelect is a lightweight macOS selection toolbar utility.

Cherry Studio Selection Assistant
---------------------------------

LightSelect 2.0 copies and adapts selection-assistant source code from Cherry
Studio. The pinned upstream files, their SHA-256 hashes, and adaptation boundary
are recorded in:

Vendor/CherryStudioSelection/UPSTREAM.md
Vendor/CherryStudioSelection/manifest.txt

Upstream repository: https://github.com/CherryHQ/cherry-studio
Pinned commit: 83d9d6325f7a00ab03a59eea31d0c943b3acf530
License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
License copy: Vendor/CherryStudioSelection/LICENSE

Copied material includes the selection toolbar, action window, selection
settings, related tests and types, selection service behavior, theme details,
and the Cherry Studio logo. Electron IPC, application preferences, provider
services, and window management are adapted for LightSelect's native Swift and
WebKit architecture.

